WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.563
- Anyone wanna try out an
American accent for me?

00:00:02.856 --> 00:00:03.689
- Yeehaw!

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:05.273
So, howdy partner.

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:07.448
We goin' down go do some shootin'.

00:00:07.448 --> 00:00:10.115
(playful music)

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:14.580
- Hi, I'm Ben and right now
I'm traveling through Europe

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:17.430
and I figured I would ask
Europeans along the way

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:19.733
what do they think of Americans?

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:20.853
Let's go find out.

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:23.335
I want you to be as honest
as you can, all right?

00:00:23.335 --> 00:00:24.168
- Yeah.

00:00:24.168 --> 00:00:25.800
- So what's the first thing
that comes to your mind

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:27.323
when you think of Americans?

00:00:28.097 --> 00:00:29.105
- Ooh! (laughs)

00:00:29.105 --> 00:00:29.938
- Loud.

00:00:30.166 --> 00:00:30.999
- Loud.

00:00:30.999 --> 00:00:31.832
- Loud.

00:00:32.036 --> 00:00:32.869
- I would say loud.

00:00:32.869 --> 00:00:33.960
- Pretty loud sometimes. (laughs)

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:34.793
- Loud.

00:00:34.793 --> 00:00:36.240
Everyone says loud.

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:37.073
- Friendly.

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:38.433
Like nice.

00:00:38.452 --> 00:00:39.430
- Good teeth.

00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:40.773
- They like to drink beer.

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:41.833
They're nice people.

00:00:42.050 --> 00:00:45.300
- They like drinking as does Austrians.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:46.453
- Enthusiastic.

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:48.690
- What's the first
thing that comes to mind

00:00:48.930 --> 00:00:50.653
when you think of Americans?

00:00:51.392 --> 00:00:54.500
- Hm. Superficial. (laughs)

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:55.620
- We like Americans.

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:57.113
They are always quite cool.

00:00:58.150 --> 00:00:59.780
They like fast food.

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:00.990
We don't like that so much,

00:01:00.990 --> 00:01:02.743
but when we are there we enjoy it.

00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:04.430
- I mean, the stereotypes is like-

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:05.263
- [Ben] Yep.

00:01:05.263 --> 00:01:06.743
- ...kind of fat and all that.

00:01:06.810 --> 00:01:07.760
- Fast food.

00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:08.910
- They eat a lot of food.

00:01:08.910 --> 00:01:10.600
Like the portions are like really big.

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:11.843
Burgers and coke.

00:01:12.070 --> 00:01:13.130
- Food very fast.

00:01:13.130 --> 00:01:14.710
- I think of fast food restaurants.

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:16.540
Five Guys. I love Five Guys.

00:01:16.540 --> 00:01:18.950
- [Ben] Okay, so of all
the things about America,

00:01:18.950 --> 00:01:20.779
the one thing you can think of-

00:01:20.779 --> 00:01:22.180
- Yeah and I think of Trump too.

00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:23.040
- Donald Trump.

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:23.873
- Trump.

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:25.670
- Just like Donald Trump, isn't it?

00:01:25.950 --> 00:01:28.100
Everyone hatin' on him
or absolutely lovin' him.

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:29.350
It's like one of the two.

00:01:37.107 --> 00:01:39.460
- I like, uh, the Trump. Yes?

00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:40.293
- You do?

00:01:40.508 --> 00:01:41.372
- Yes. (laughs)

00:01:41.372 --> 00:01:42.205
I like it.

00:01:42.751 --> 00:01:44.301
- What do you like about Trump?

00:01:44.380 --> 00:01:49.380
- He's mean about the world
and about the situation now.

00:01:50.150 --> 00:01:52.050
- You like him because he's mean?

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:53.390
- He's very racist.

00:01:53.390 --> 00:01:56.500
He doesn't really know
anything about politics.

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:59.290
- When you see like Americans,
they're really open-minded.

00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:01.880
They're...like most of
them are really smart

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:04.600
and we can't understand that
Trump is your president.

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:05.870
- That's a big laugh, you know?

00:02:05.870 --> 00:02:08.390
People voted for him. You
get what you voted for.

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:10.970
- Like I know basically everyone
in Europe is against Trump,

00:02:10.970 --> 00:02:13.890
but I think they needed a change.

00:02:13.890 --> 00:02:16.040
I just think that the two coasts dominated

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:18.120
and there's so many people in the middle

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:19.690
they don't get heard and
they're finally getting heard.

00:02:19.690 --> 00:02:22.770
- I do like in America
that everyone's kind of,

00:02:22.770 --> 00:02:25.313
If you're born there, you're American,

00:02:25.420 --> 00:02:27.599
and if you're from another country

00:02:27.599 --> 00:02:31.260
and you're moving to Austria
and your children are born here

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:34.117
you're still like,
"Yeah, I'm from Austria,

00:02:34.117 --> 00:02:36.180
"but, you know, my
heritage is this and that."

00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:39.603
- America is the land of
change, of opportunity.

00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:42.453
- Actually, I think of
the American dream like,

00:02:43.170 --> 00:02:45.170
This way from the
dishwasher to a millionaire.

00:02:45.170 --> 00:02:47.140
You can make everything if you just wanted

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:48.963
to make it and do it.

00:02:49.170 --> 00:02:50.010
- I think like people look at America

00:02:50.010 --> 00:02:52.010
and they like idolize it.

00:02:52.010 --> 00:02:53.260
You know like, "Oh it's America."

00:02:53.260 --> 00:02:55.000
Yeah. Everyone wants to go to America.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:56.650
- I was pretty keen
about going to America,

00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:59.443
but I think the whole
Trump has put me off.

00:02:59.480 --> 00:03:00.760
I'm not as keen to go anymore.

00:03:00.760 --> 00:03:02.460
It wouldn't be the top of my list.

00:03:05.470 --> 00:03:07.243
- I just don't see what
you need to have a gun.

00:03:07.243 --> 00:03:09.510
- I think Poland's guns
are really hard to get,

00:03:09.510 --> 00:03:10.720
still kinda illegal.

00:03:10.720 --> 00:03:13.490
- And here, it's not
that easy to get a gun.

00:03:13.490 --> 00:03:14.760
- There's far too many guns in America.

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:16.860
Of course their laws need to be restricted

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:18.550
and it's really hard for us to understand

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:20.363
because in Ireland there is no guns.

00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:22.150
The police aren't armed.

00:03:22.170 --> 00:03:25.380
It's just so systemic in your culture.

00:03:25.380 --> 00:03:27.230
I don't know how you could change it,

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:28.803
but you definitely need to try.

00:03:29.340 --> 00:03:30.469
- It's a big country, you know?

00:03:30.469 --> 00:03:31.302
- [Ben] Yeah.

00:03:31.302 --> 00:03:32.985
- You've got big problems.

00:03:32.985 --> 00:03:33.818
- (laughs) We do.

00:03:33.818 --> 00:03:34.651
- Yeah.

00:03:34.651 --> 00:03:37.318
(playful music)

